    "title": "SCENE III. Another part of the field.",
    "location": "Another part of the field.",
    "orderInPlay": 27
  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Posthumus and a Briton Lord."
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lord",
        "name": "LORD",
        "displayName": "Lord"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Cam'st thou from where they made the stand?",
          "plainText": "Cam'st thou from where they made the stand",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "posthumus",
        "name": "POSTHUMUS",
        "displayName": "Posthumus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I did:",
          "plainText": "I did",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Though you, it seems, come from the fliers.",
          "plainText": "Though you it seems come from the fliers",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lord",
        "name": "LORD",
        "displayName": "Lord"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I did.",
          "plainText": "I did",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "posthumus",
        "name": "POSTHUMUS",
        "displayName": "Posthumus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No blame be to you, sir, for all was lost,",
          "plainText": "No blame be to you sir for all was lost",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "But that the heavens fought. The King himself",
          "plainText": "But that the heavens fought The King himself",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Of his wings destitute, the army broken,",
          "plainText": "Of his wings destitute the army broken",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "And but the backs of Britons seen, all flying,",
          "plainText": "And but the backs of Britons seen all flying",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Through a strait lane; the enemy, full-hearted,",
          "plainText": "Through a strait lane the enemy fullhearted",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Lolling the tongue with slaught'ring, having work",
          "plainText": "Lolling the tongue with slaught'ring having work",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "More plentiful than tools to do't, struck down",
          "plainText": "More plentiful than tools to do't struck down",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "Some mortally, some slightly touch'd, some falling",
          "plainText": "Some mortally some slightly touch'd some falling",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Merely through fear, that the strait pass was damm'd",
          "plainText": "Merely through fear that the strait pass was damm'd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "With dead men hurt behind, and cowards living",
          "plainText": "With dead men hurt behind and cowards living",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "To die with length'ned shame.",
          "plainText": "To die with length'ned shame",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lord",
        "name": "LORD",
        "displayName": "Lord"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Where was this lane?",
          "plainText": "Where was this lane",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "posthumus",
        "name": "POSTHUMUS",
        "displayName": "Posthumus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Close by the battle, ditch'd, and wall'd with turf,",
          "plainText": "Close by the battle ditch'd and wall'd with turf",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Which gave advantage to an ancient soldier,",
          "plainText": "Which gave advantage to an ancient soldier",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "An honest one, I warrant, who deserv'd",
          "plainText": "An honest one I warrant who deserv'd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "So long a breeding as his white beard came to,",
          "plainText": "So long a breeding as his white beard came to",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "In doing this for's country. Athwart the lane",
          "plainText": "In doing this for's country Athwart the lane",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "He, with two striplings (lads more like to run",
          "plainText": "He with two striplings lads more like to run",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "The country base than to commit such slaughter;",
          "plainText": "The country base than to commit such slaughter",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "With faces fit for masks, or rather fairer",
          "plainText": "With faces fit for masks or rather fairer",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Than those for preservation cas'd or shame)",
          "plainText": "Than those for preservation cas'd or shame",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "Made good the passage, cried to those that fled",
          "plainText": "Made good the passage cried to those that fled",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "'Our Britain's harts die flying, not our men.",
          "plainText": "'Our Britain's harts die flying not our men",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "To darkness fleet souls that fly backwards! Stand;",
          "plainText": "To darkness fleet souls that fly backwards Stand",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "Or we are Romans and will give you that,",
          "plainText": "Or we are Romans and will give you that",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 14,
          "text": "Like beasts, which you shun beastly, and may save",
          "plainText": "Like beasts which you shun beastly and may save",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 15,
          "text": "But to look back in frown. Stand, stand!' These three,",
          "plainText": "But to look back in frown Stand stand' These three",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 16,
          "text": "Three thousand confident, in act as many—",
          "plainText": "Three thousand confident in act as many",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 17,
          "text": "For three performers are the file when all",
          "plainText": "For three performers are the file when all",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 18,
          "text": "The rest do nothing—with this word 'Stand, stand!'",
          "plainText": "The rest do nothingwith this word 'Stand stand'",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 19,
          "text": "Accommodated by the place, more charming",
          "plainText": "Accommodated by the place more charming",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0036",
          "number": 36,
          "speechLineNumber": 20,
          "text": "With their own nobleness, which could have turn'd",
          "plainText": "With their own nobleness which could have turn'd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0037",
          "number": 37,
          "speechLineNumber": 21,
          "text": "A distaff to a lance, gilded pale looks,",
          "plainText": "A distaff to a lance gilded pale looks",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0038",
          "number": 38,
          "speechLineNumber": 22,
          "text": "Part shame, part spirit renew'd; that some turn'd coward",
          "plainText": "Part shame part spirit renew'd that some turn'd coward",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0039",
          "number": 39,
          "speechLineNumber": 23,
          "text": "But by example (O, a sin in war",
          "plainText": "But by example O a sin in war",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0040",
          "number": 40,
          "speechLineNumber": 24,
          "text": "Damn'd in the first beginners) 'gan to look",
          "plainText": "Damn'd in the first beginners 'gan to look",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0041",
          "number": 41,
          "speechLineNumber": 25,
          "text": "The way that they did and to grin like lions",
          "plainText": "The way that they did and to grin like lions",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0042",
          "number": 42,
          "speechLineNumber": 26,
          "text": "Upon the pikes o' th' hunters. Then began",
          "plainText": "Upon the pikes o' th' hunters Then began",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0043",
          "number": 43,
          "speechLineNumber": 27,
          "text": "A stop i' th' chaser, a retire; anon",
          "plainText": "A stop i' th' chaser a retire anon",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0044",
          "number": 44,
          "speechLineNumber": 28,
          "text": "A rout, confusion thick. Forthwith they fly,",
          "plainText": "A rout confusion thick Forthwith they fly",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0045",
          "number": 45,
          "speechLineNumber": 29,
          "text": "Chickens, the way which they stoop'd eagles; slaves,",
          "plainText": "Chickens the way which they stoop'd eagles slaves",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0046",
          "number": 46,
          "speechLineNumber": 30,
          "text": "The strides they victors made; and now our cowards,",
          "plainText": "The strides they victors made and now our cowards",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0047",
          "number": 47,
          "speechLineNumber": 31,
          "text": "Like fragments in hard voyages, became",
          "plainText": "Like fragments in hard voyages became",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0048",
          "number": 48,
          "speechLineNumber": 32,
          "text": "The life o' th' need. Having found the back-door open",
          "plainText": "The life o' th' need Having found the backdoor open",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0049",
          "number": 49,
          "speechLineNumber": 33,
          "text": "Of the unguarded hearts, heavens, how they wound!",
          "plainText": "Of the unguarded hearts heavens how they wound",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0050",
          "number": 50,
          "speechLineNumber": 34,
          "text": "Some slain before, some dying, some their friends",
          "plainText": "Some slain before some dying some their friends",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0051",
          "number": 51,
          "speechLineNumber": 35,
          "text": "O'erborne i' th' former wave. Ten chas'd by one",
          "plainText": "O'erborne i' th' former wave Ten chas'd by one",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0052",
          "number": 52,
          "speechLineNumber": 36,
          "text": "Are now each one the slaughterman of twenty.",
          "plainText": "Are now each one the slaughterman of twenty",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0053",
          "number": 53,
          "speechLineNumber": 37,
          "text": "Those that would die or ere resist are grown",
          "plainText": "Those that would die or ere resist are grown",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0054",
          "number": 54,
          "speechLineNumber": 38,
          "text": "The mortal bugs o' th' field.",
          "plainText": "The mortal bugs o' th' field",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lord",
        "name": "LORD",
        "displayName": "Lord"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0055",
          "number": 55,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "This was strange chance:",
          "plainText": "This was strange chance",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0056",
          "number": 56,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "A narrow lane, an old man, and two boys.",
          "plainText": "A narrow lane an old man and two boys",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "posthumus",
        "name": "POSTHUMUS",
        "displayName": "Posthumus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0057",
          "number": 57,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nay, do not wonder at it; you are made",
          "plainText": "Nay do not wonder at it you are made",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0058",
          "number": 58,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Rather to wonder at the things you hear",
          "plainText": "Rather to wonder at the things you hear",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0059",
          "number": 59,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Than to work any. Will you rhyme upon't,",
          "plainText": "Than to work any Will you rhyme upon't",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0060",
          "number": 60,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "And vent it for a mock'ry? Here is one:",
          "plainText": "And vent it for a mock'ry Here is one",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lord",
        "name": "LORD",
        "displayName": "Lord"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0061",
          "number": 61,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nay, be not angry, sir.",
          "plainText": "Nay be not angry sir",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "posthumus",
        "name": "POSTHUMUS",
        "displayName": "Posthumus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0062",
          "number": 62,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "'Lack, to what end?",
          "plainText": "'Lack to what end",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0063",
          "number": 63,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Who dares not stand his foe I'll be his friend;",
          "plainText": "Who dares not stand his foe I'll be his friend",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0064",
          "number": 64,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "For if he'll do as he is made to do,",
          "plainText": "For if he'll do as he is made to do",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0065",
          "number": 65,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "I know he'll quickly fly my friendship too.",
          "plainText": "I know he'll quickly fly my friendship too",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0066",
          "number": 66,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "You have put me into rhyme.",
          "plainText": "You have put me into rhyme",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-011",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lord",
        "name": "LORD",
        "displayName": "Lord"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0067",
          "number": 67,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Farewell; you're angry.",
          "plainText": "Farewell you're angry",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exit.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-012",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "posthumus",
        "name": "POSTHUMUS",
        "displayName": "Posthumus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0068",
          "number": 68,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Still going? This is a lord! O noble misery,",
          "plainText": "Still going This is a lord O noble misery",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0069",
          "number": 69,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "To be i' th' field and ask 'What news?' of me!",
          "plainText": "To be i' th' field and ask 'What news' of me",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0070",
          "number": 70,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Today how many would have given their honours",
          "plainText": "Today how many would have given their honours",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0071",
          "number": 71,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "To have sav'd their carcasses! took heel to do't,",
          "plainText": "To have sav'd their carcasses took heel to do't",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0072",
          "number": 72,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "And yet died too! I, in mine own woe charm'd,",
          "plainText": "And yet died too I in mine own woe charm'd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0073",
          "number": 73,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Could not find death where I did hear him groan,",
          "plainText": "Could not find death where I did hear him groan",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0074",
          "number": 74,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "Nor feel him where he struck. Being an ugly monster,",
          "plainText": "Nor feel him where he struck Being an ugly monster",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0075",
          "number": 75,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "'Tis strange he hides him in fresh cups, soft beds,",
          "plainText": "'Tis strange he hides him in fresh cups soft beds",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0076",
          "number": 76,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Sweet words; or hath moe ministers than we",
          "plainText": "Sweet words or hath moe ministers than we",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0077",
          "number": 77,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "That draw his knives i' th' war. Well, I will find him;",
          "plainText": "That draw his knives i' th' war Well I will find him",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0078",
          "number": 78,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "For being now a favourer to the Briton,",
          "plainText": "For being now a favourer to the Briton",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0079",
          "number": 79,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "No more a Briton, I have resum'd again",
          "plainText": "No more a Briton I have resum'd again",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0080",
          "number": 80,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "The part I came in. Fight I will no more,",
          "plainText": "The part I came in Fight I will no more",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0081",
          "number": 81,
          "speechLineNumber": 14,
          "text": "But yield me to the veriest hind that shall",
          "plainText": "But yield me to the veriest hind that shall",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0082",
          "number": 82,
          "speechLineNumber": 15,
          "text": "Once touch my shoulder. Great the slaughter is",
          "plainText": "Once touch my shoulder Great the slaughter is",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0083",
          "number": 83,
          "speechLineNumber": 16,
          "text": "Here made by th' Roman; great the answer be",
          "plainText": "Here made by th' Roman great the answer be",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0084",
          "number": 84,
          "speechLineNumber": 17,
          "text": "Britons must take. For me, my ransom's death;",
          "plainText": "Britons must take For me my ransom's death",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0085",
          "number": 85,
          "speechLineNumber": 18,
          "text": "On either side I come to spend my breath,",
          "plainText": "On either side I come to spend my breath",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0086",
          "number": 86,
          "speechLineNumber": 19,
          "text": "Which neither here I'll keep nor bear again,",
          "plainText": "Which neither here I'll keep nor bear again",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0087",
          "number": 87,
          "speechLineNumber": 20,
          "text": "But end it by some means for Imogen.",
          "plainText": "But end it by some means for Imogen",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-stage-003",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter two British Captains and soldiers."
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-013",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-captain",
        "name": "FIRST CAPTAIN",
        "displayName": "First Captain"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0088",
          "number": 88,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Great Jupiter be prais'd! Lucius is taken.",
          "plainText": "Great Jupiter be prais'd Lucius is taken",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0089",
          "number": 89,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "'Tis thought the old man and his sons were angels.",
          "plainText": "'Tis thought the old man and his sons were angels",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-014",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-captain",
        "name": "SECOND CAPTAIN",
        "displayName": "Second Captain"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0090",
          "number": 90,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "There was a fourth man, in a silly habit,",
          "plainText": "There was a fourth man in a silly habit",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0091",
          "number": 91,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "That gave th' affront with them.",
          "plainText": "That gave th' affront with them",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-015",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-captain",
        "name": "FIRST CAPTAIN",
        "displayName": "First Captain"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0092",
          "number": 92,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "So 'tis reported;",
          "plainText": "So 'tis reported",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0093",
          "number": 93,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "But none of 'em can be found. Stand! who's there?",
          "plainText": "But none of 'em can be found Stand who's there",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-016",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "posthumus",
        "name": "POSTHUMUS",
        "displayName": "Posthumus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0094",
          "number": 94,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "A Roman,",
          "plainText": "A Roman",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0095",
          "number": 95,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Who had not now been drooping here if seconds",
          "plainText": "Who had not now been drooping here if seconds",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0096",
          "number": 96,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Had answer'd him.",
          "plainText": "Had answer'd him",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-speech-017",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-captain",
        "name": "SECOND CAPTAIN",
        "displayName": "Second Captain"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0097",
          "number": 97,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Lay hands on him; a dog!",
          "plainText": "Lay hands on him a dog",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0098",
          "number": 98,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "A leg of Rome shall not return to tell",
          "plainText": "A leg of Rome shall not return to tell",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0099",
          "number": 99,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "What crows have peck'd them here. He brags his service,",
          "plainText": "What crows have peck'd them here He brags his service",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline-5-3-line-0100",
          "number": 100,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "As if he were of note. Bring him to th' King.",
          "plainText": "As if he were of note Bring him to th' King",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-stage-004",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Cymbeline, Belarius, Guiderius, Arviragus, Pisanio and Roman captives. The Captains present Posthumus to Cymbeline, who delivers him over to a gaoler."
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline-5-3-stage-005",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exeunt omnes.]"
    }
  ]
}